IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ea-elector`

-- Electoral Act 1907 (WA), the State elector, ss 4, 17, 17AA, 18, 31, 31A, 35A, 45, 155AB, 156 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_electoral-act-1907_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Dates of birth are those in the workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-{chloe,jake}/facts.json: Chloe 14 March
-- 2003, Jake 30 August 2006 (both taken to have lived in their district since birth, as the Commonwealth baseline
-- takes them at their address). State polling days: 13 March 2021 (c024), 8 March 2025 (c046), 8 March 2029 (k045),
-- the events' own dates. Other people are HYPOTHETICAL and named as such.

